Package: com.gokuencinar.bandlock
Name: BandLock (RootHide LTE Scan Test)
Version: 1.5.1~rhscan5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Experimental RootHide LTE scanner and read-only RAT selection diagnostics distinguishing successful CoreTelephony calls from explicitly unknown selections; retains original-band recovery and strict LTE-only gating. Cellular and emergency service may be interrupted.
Maintainer: Gokuencinar
Author: Gokuencinar
Section: Tweaks
Homepage: https://github.com/Gokuencinar/GokuEnREPO/blob/main/tweaks/BandLock/README.md
